<title>HONG KONG: Merrill sets warrants on Shanghai Ind.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets warrants on Shanghai Ind.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co, C.V. said on Monday it launched 124 million American-style call warrants on shares of Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$23.36	  PREMIUM	     23.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.4183	 GEARING	     5.32X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  18.NOV.97	 BOARD LOT	   10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	 SPOT REFERENCE    HK$22.25</p>
<p>NOTES: PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY AT EXERCISE. GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
